{"id":591,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"ICTと探究で創造力を育てる近大豊岡の教育","feature_description":"近畿大学附属豊岡は、実学教育と人格の陶冶を基盤に、ICTと文理融合の探究を進める中高一貫校です。生成AIやデータサイエンスにも触れながら、社会課題を見つけて考える力を養います。近畿大学の講義や体験に参加する機会を設け、専門分野や将来の進路を具体的に考えます。探究と大学連携を通じ、創造力と主体的に学び続ける姿勢を育てる教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11255,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11256,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11257,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11258,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11259,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11260,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11261,"name":"琴部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11262,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11263,"name":"自然科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11264,"name":"英会話部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11265,"name":"なぎなた同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11266,"name":"放送同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.kindai-toyooka.ed.jp/j-school/landing/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":2017